## Known Limitations

1. **Inventory section** (Main Setup > Inventory): Core modules exist but no dedicated tabbed UI window. Individual masters can be accessed via existing UI files.
2. **Reports/Printing**: VB6 uses Crystal Reports (.RPT files). Python uses text-based report generation. Full Crystal Reports parity is not implemented.
3. **Permissions**: VB6 uses UserModule/UserPermission tables. Python uses a simplified permission system. Full permission parity is not implemented.
4. **Transactions**: VB6 uses explicit BeginTrans/CommitTrans/RollbackTrans. Python uses db.transaction() context manager. Behavior is equivalent.

